rhythm echo consent prune: delete old consent results, keeping the newest n (default 20) and every baseline

Usage:
  rhythm echo consent prune [--keep <n>]

Flags:
  -q, --quiet                only the verdict and what failed
      --config <file>        settings (default the nearest .echo/config.yaml;
                             optional)
      --store <dir>          where results are kept (default the config's
                             folder, else ./.echo)
      --keep <n>             how many consent results to keep (default 20);
                             baselines always stay

Exit codes: 0 ok, 2 usage error, 3 couldn't run.
rhythm echo consent --help lists the consent check's flags.
rhythm echo help lists every command.
